{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>全球最大、幾乎是唯一的 Apple 安全會議 Objective by the Sea（OBTS）本週在夏威夷舉行，今年踏入第九屆。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"文章配圖\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"384\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/946908d02cae18dfcf3b8a141e1112463a919d1a77b115ae9d57626deb2a7a9c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F7585810bc91ff1a866debf47b45f4998.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><h2>第九屆議程週三展開</h2><p>OBTS 由 Patrick Wardle 與 Objective-See Foundation 主辦，訓練活動已經展開，正式演講由週三舉行至週五。今年講者包括 Csaba Fitzl、Sarah Edwards、Cat Self 及 Jaron Bradley，Patrick Wardle 亦會登場。</p><p></p><p>Patrick Wardle 在 9 月披露 Meta Muse 零日漏洞後，預告將談及更多 AI agent 漏洞。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><h2>部分演講將上載 YouTube</h2><p>Patrick Wardle 表示，部分演講會在情況許可時上載至 YouTube，但並非所有演講都保證上線。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T17:46:13.845628+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":360,"images":1,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T17:04:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:47:48.175960+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T17:39:39.366950+00:00","content_hash":"56cb4f28f07d9c256265c28bd5cc4dc8d741530484be3778e17bb5364564fa76","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}